Rep. Albert S. Garcia: The budget hearing of the Committee on Appropriations on House Bill No. 10858, the Fiscal Year 2027 General Appropriations Bill, is hereby resumed.

asr-000002
00:04:18.330 --> 00:04:28.470
Rep. Albert S. Garcia: Please rise for the singing of the National Anthem and remain standing for the prayer to be led by Vice Chair Irene Labad-Labad.

asr-000003
00:04:38.240 --> 00:05:17.920
National Anthem video singers: [unclear]

asr-000004
00:05:17.940 --> 00:05:27.600
