asr-000005
00:05:28.880 --> 00:05:38.040
National Anthem video singers: Habi'y gaya na pag may mga abig, ang mamatay ng dahil sa'yo.

asr-000006
00:05:46.100 --> 00:05:53.820
Rep. Irene G. Labadlabad: Almighty God, we come before you today with grateful hearts as we begin this budget briefing of the Office of the President.

asr-000007
00:05:54.200 --> 00:05:55.400
Rep. Irene G. Labadlabad: Grant wisdom.

asr-000008
00:05:55.420 --> 00:06:03.680
Rep. Irene G. Labadlabad: Grant wisdom and discernment to the Chair, the Honorable Members of this Committee, and all officials and representatives gathered here today.

asr-000009
00:06:04.480 --> 00:06:14.140
Rep. Irene G. Labadlabad: Guide our discussions so that they may be conducted with respect, transparency, and a sincere commitment to the welfare of the Filipino people.

asr-000010
00:06:15.020 --> 00:06:22.840
Rep. Irene G. Labadlabad: As we deliberate on the resources entrusted to government, remind us that public funds are a public trust.

asr-000011
00:06:22.840 --> 00:06:25.120
Rep. Irene G. Labadlabad: Give us the wisdom to distinguish.

asr-000012
00:06:25.420 --> 00:06:31.940
Rep. Irene G. Labadlabad: What is necessary, and the prudence to ensure that every peso serves a meaningful public purpose.

asr-000013
00:06:32.740 --> 00:06:39.680
Rep. Irene G. Labadlabad: May our decisions uplift our communities, strengthen our institutions, and advance the common good.

asr-000014
00:06:40.540 --> 00:06:45.920
Rep. Irene G. Labadlabad: Bless our leaders, our nation, and the people whom we are privileged to serve.

asr-000015
00:06:46.440 --> 00:06:49.540
Rep. Irene G. Labadlabad: With humility and faith, we offer this prayer.

asr-000016
00:06:50.180 --> 00:06:50.380
Rep. Irene G. Labadlabad: Amen.

