asr-000061
00:10:36.080 --> 00:10:40.080
Rep. Albert S. Garcia: Maraming salamat, Committee Secretary.

asr-000062
00:10:40.080 --> 00:10:47.080
Rep. Albert S. Garcia: To the Honorable Executive Secretary Ralph Recto, our former colleague,

asr-000063
00:10:47.080 --> 00:10:51.080
Rep. Albert S. Garcia: and the officials of the Office of the President,

asr-000064
00:10:51.080 --> 00:10:57.480
Rep. Albert S. Garcia: Senior Deputy Speaker Ferdinand Hernandez,

asr-000065
00:10:57.480 --> 00:11:00.480
Rep. Albert S. Garcia: Chair Mika Suansing,

asr-000066
00:11:00.480 --> 00:11:03.480
Rep. Albert S. Garcia: distinguished members of the Committee on Appropriations,

asr-000067
00:11:03.480 --> 00:11:07.480
Rep. Albert S. Garcia: my esteemed colleagues in the House of Representatives,

asr-000068
00:11:07.480 --> 00:11:09.480
Rep. Albert S. Garcia: our honored guests,

asr-000069
00:11:09.480 --> 00:11:12.480
Rep. Albert S. Garcia: isang magandang umaga po sa ating lahat.

asr-000070
00:11:12.480 --> 00:11:15.480
Rep. Albert S. Garcia: Today, we deliberate on the proposed

asr-000071
00:11:15.480 --> 00:11:26.480
Rep. Albert S. Garcia: 10,156,000,000 budget allocation of the Office of the President for Fiscal Year 2027.

asr-000072
00:11:26.480 --> 00:11:32.480
Rep. Albert S. Garcia: The proposed budget is intended to ensure that the country's highest executive office,

asr-000073
00:11:32.480 --> 00:11:40.480
Rep. Albert S. Garcia: is fully equipped to carry out its constitutional and administrative mandates,

asr-000074
00:11:40.480 --> 00:11:45.480
Rep. Albert S. Garcia: and to respond to the specific needs and requirements of the President

asr-000075
00:11:45.480 --> 00:11:51.480
Rep. Albert S. Garcia: in exercise of his responsibility as Head of State and Government,

asr-000076
00:11:51.480 --> 00:11:55.480
Rep. Albert S. Garcia: Chief Executive, and Commander-in-Chief.

asr-000077
00:11:55.480 --> 00:12:00.480
Rep. Albert S. Garcia: The Office of the President is mandated to assist the President

asr-000078
00:12:00.480 --> 00:12:05.480
Rep. Albert S. Garcia: in the management of the affairs of the Government of the Republic of the Philippines,

asr-000079
00:12:05.480 --> 00:12:11.480
Rep. Albert S. Garcia: to provide consultative research, fact-finding, and advisory services to the President,

asr-000080
00:12:11.480 --> 00:12:17.480
Rep. Albert S. Garcia: and to provide technical and administrative support on matters concerning development,

asr-000081
00:12:17.480 --> 00:12:23.480
Rep. Albert S. Garcia: management, general government administration, and internal administration.

asr-000082
00:12:23.480 --> 00:12:29.480
Rep. Albert S. Garcia: In this regard, the proposed budget is designed to provide the necessary resources

asr-000083
00:12:29.480 --> 00:12:36.480
Rep. Albert S. Garcia: for the Office of the President to effectively fulfill its mandate and responsibilities,

asr-000084
00:12:36.480 --> 00:12:42.480
Rep. Albert S. Garcia: ensure timely, efficient, and responsive support to the President,

asr-000085
00:12:42.480 --> 00:12:50.480
Rep. Albert S. Garcia: sustain the administrative, advisory, consultative, and other essential functions of the Office,

asr-000086
00:12:50.480 --> 00:12:55.480
Rep. Albert S. Garcia: and to strengthen coordination across the Government.

asr-000087
00:12:55.480 --> 00:12:57.480
Rep. Albert S. Garcia: With this in mind,

asr-000088
00:12:57.480 --> 00:12:59.480
Rep. Albert S. Garcia: the proposed 10,000,000,000,000

asr-000089
00:12:59.480 --> 00:13:02.480
Rep. Albert S. Garcia: or 156,000,000 budget

asr-000090
00:13:02.480 --> 00:13:11.480
Rep. Albert S. Garcia: is directed towards advancing the interests and serving the needs of the Filipino people.

asr-000091
00:13:11.480 --> 00:13:13.480
Rep. Albert S. Garcia: Maraming salamat po muli

asr-000092
00:13:13.480 --> 00:13:16.480
Rep. Albert S. Garcia: at magandang umaga sa ating lahat.

asr-000093
00:13:16.480 --> 00:13:21.480
Rep. Albert S. Garcia: Once again, kay ES at sa buong Office of the President family,

asr-000094
00:13:21.480 --> 00:13:24.480
Rep. Albert S. Garcia: welcome to the House of the People.

asr-000095
00:13:24.480 --> 00:13:26.480
Rep. Albert S. Garcia: With that,

asr-000096
00:13:26.480 --> 00:13:28.480
Rep. Albert S. Garcia: may I

asr-000097
00:13:33.200 --> 00:13:34.200
Rep. Albert S. Garcia: request

asr-000098
00:13:34.200 --> 00:13:41.200
Rep. Albert S. Garcia: the Office of the President to proceed with their presentation for their budget for Fiscal Year 2027.

asr-000099
00:13:41.200 --> 00:13:42.200
Rep. Albert S. Garcia: Thank you.

asr-000100
00:13:44.570 --> 00:13:47.570
Executive Secretary Ralph Recto: Thank you very much, Mr. Chairman,

asr-000101
00:13:47.570 --> 00:13:49.570
Executive Secretary Ralph Recto: former colleagues,

asr-000102
00:13:49.570 --> 00:13:51.570
Executive Secretary Ralph Recto: Magandang umaga sa inyong lahat.

asr-000103
00:13:51.570 --> 00:13:52.570
Executive Secretary Ralph Recto: Good morning.

asr-000104
00:13:52.570 --> 00:13:53.570
Executive Secretary Ralph Recto: Your Honors,

asr-000105
00:13:53.570 --> 00:13:58.570
Executive Secretary Ralph Recto: I appear before this distinguished body to present, explain, and more importantly,

asr-000106
00:13:58.570 --> 00:14:03.570
Executive Secretary Ralph Recto: seek your support for the proposed 2027 budget of the Office of the President.

asr-000107
00:14:04.570 --> 00:14:06.570
Executive Secretary Ralph Recto: I am here not merely because our laws require

asr-000108
00:14:06.570 --> 00:14:09.570
Executive Secretary Ralph Recto: the Executive to defend its budget before Congress,

asr-000109
00:14:09.570 --> 00:14:12.570
Executive Secretary Ralph Recto: which holds the constitutional power of the purse.

asr-000110
00:14:12.570 --> 00:14:15.570
Executive Secretary Ralph Recto: I am here above all in faithful compliance

asr-000111
00:14:15.570 --> 00:14:18.570
Executive Secretary Ralph Recto: with the President's standing directive,

asr-000112
00:14:18.570 --> 00:14:20.570
Executive Secretary Ralph Recto: honor Congress,

asr-000113
00:14:20.570 --> 00:14:22.570
Executive Secretary Ralph Recto: respect its mandate,

asr-000114
00:14:22.570 --> 00:14:24.570
Executive Secretary Ralph Recto: and regard it as a full partner

asr-000115
00:14:24.570 --> 00:14:27.570
Executive Secretary Ralph Recto: in advancing the welfare of our people

asr-000116
00:14:27.570 --> 00:14:30.570
Executive Secretary Ralph Recto: and protecting the national interests.

asr-000117
00:14:30.570 --> 00:14:33.570
Executive Secretary Ralph Recto: The President firmly believes that governance is strengthened

asr-000118
00:14:33.570 --> 00:14:36.570
Executive Secretary Ralph Recto: when the Executive and Legislative branches work together,

asr-000119
00:14:36.570 --> 00:14:39.570
Executive Secretary Ralph Recto: not as competing centers of power,

asr-000120
00:14:39.570 --> 00:14:44.680
Executive Secretary Ralph Recto: but as co-equal institutions

asr-000121
00:14:44.680 --> 00:14:47.680
Executive Secretary Ralph Recto: united by common duty to the Filipino people.

asr-000122
00:14:47.680 --> 00:14:52.680
Executive Secretary Ralph Recto: To enable the Office of the President to perform its constitutional responsibilities,

asr-000123
00:14:52.680 --> 00:14:57.680
Executive Secretary Ralph Recto: we respectfully propose a budget of 10.15 billion pesos

asr-000124
00:14:57.680 --> 00:14:59.680
Executive Secretary Ralph Recto: for 2027.

asr-000125
00:15:00.000 --> 00:15:12.480
Executive Secretary Ralph Recto: This represents only 0.14% or roughly one-seventh of 1% of the proposed P7.2 trillion national budget.

asr-000126
00:15:13.100 --> 00:15:17.760
Executive Secretary Ralph Recto: It is also 64% lower than the previous year's level.

asr-000127
00:15:18.560 --> 00:15:23.800
Executive Secretary Ralph Recto: This substantial reduction reflects the lower operational requirements of our delivery units

asr-000128
00:15:23.800 --> 00:15:28.880
Executive Secretary Ralph Recto: and the completion of activities related to the Philippines' hosting of the ASEAN Summit,

asr-000129
00:15:28.880 --> 00:15:33.240
Executive Secretary Ralph Recto: for which no additional funding will be required next year.

asr-000130
00:15:33.900 --> 00:15:39.100
Executive Secretary Ralph Recto: In short, we're asking for less while remaining fully prepared to do more.

asr-000131
00:15:39.880 --> 00:15:46.040
Executive Secretary Ralph Recto: We believe this amount is sufficient for the Presidency to meet the exacting demands of leading the nation

asr-000132
00:15:46.040 --> 00:15:50.460
Executive Secretary Ralph Recto: at a time of overlapping domestic and external challenges,

asr-000133
00:15:50.460 --> 00:15:58.360
Executive Secretary Ralph Recto: from geopolitical tensions and disruptions in the Middle East to typhoons, El Nino, and other calamities.

asr-000134
00:15:58.980 --> 00:16:04.540
Executive Secretary Ralph Recto: This budget will sustain the work of the Office of the President's 49 delivery units,

asr-000135
00:16:05.380 --> 00:16:10.660
Executive Secretary Ralph Recto: the machinery that keeps the highest office of government delivering for the Filipino people.

asr-000136
00:16:11.600 --> 00:16:18.760
Executive Secretary Ralph Recto: It will support cabinet meetings, policy consultations, presidential engagements, and official travels,

asr-000137
00:16:19.220 --> 00:16:27.680
Executive Secretary Ralph Recto: and the daily operations of Malacanang as the nation's principal center of decision-making and executive coordination.

asr-000138
00:16:28.880 --> 00:16:32.700
Executive Secretary Ralph Recto: More importantly, it will help bring timely assistance to vulnerable families

asr-000139
00:16:32.700 --> 00:16:36.940
Executive Secretary Ralph Recto: and enable the government to respond swiftly in times of emergencies.

asr-000140
00:16:38.060 --> 00:16:44.620
Executive Secretary Ralph Recto: Every day, the President's schedule is full because the demands of governing do not pause.

asr-000141
00:16:45.520 --> 00:16:49.100
Executive Secretary Ralph Recto: But activity alone is not our measure of performance.

asr-000142
00:16:49.420 --> 00:16:57.460
Executive Secretary Ralph Recto: The real test of every peso spent is whether it solves a problem, improves a life, or strengthens the nation.

asr-000143
00:16:57.460 --> 00:17:02.320
Executive Secretary Ralph Recto: This is a standard we apply to every peso in this budget proposal.

asr-000144
00:17:03.400 --> 00:17:09.020
Executive Secretary Ralph Recto: We ensure that every policy, meeting, engagement, and official mission yields a public dividend,

asr-000145
00:17:09.500 --> 00:17:19.020
Executive Secretary Ralph Recto: whether through jobs, investment, stronger national security, better public services, or more opportunities for our people.

asr-000146
00:17:19.880 --> 00:17:24.220
Executive Secretary Ralph Recto: Your Honors, we recognize that public funds are not the government's money.

asr-000147
00:17:24.460 --> 00:17:27.440
Executive Secretary Ralph Recto: They are the people's money earned through their hard labor.

asr-000148
00:17:27.460 --> 00:17:34.040
Executive Secretary Ralph Recto: And entrusted to us in the expectation that the government will uplift their lives.

asr-000149
00:17:34.760 --> 00:17:40.760
Executive Secretary Ralph Recto: That is why fiscal discipline and accountability remain central to the operations of the President.

asr-000150
00:17:41.580 --> 00:17:49.900
Executive Secretary Ralph Recto: For Fiscal Year 2025, the Commission on Audit issued the Office of the President an unmodified opinion.

asr-000151
00:17:50.760 --> 00:17:54.840
Executive Secretary Ralph Recto: This is the highest audit opinion an agency may receive.

asr-000152
00:17:54.840 --> 00:17:56.840
Executive Secretary Ralph Recto: And the OPs...

asr-000153
00:17:57.460 --> 00:18:02.680
Executive Secretary Ralph Recto: Third consecutive unmodified opinion since 2022.

asr-000154
00:18:02.680 --> 00:18:16.680
Executive Secretary Ralph Recto: This means that based on COA's independent audit, the OPs' financial statements were presented fairly in all material respects and in accordance with applicable public sector accounting standards.

asr-000155
00:18:17.680 --> 00:18:19.680
Executive Secretary Ralph Recto: This is a badge of good housekeeping.

asr-000156
00:18:20.680 --> 00:18:26.680
Executive Secretary Ralph Recto: This is proof that the Filipino people's money is accounted for and that their trust is respected.

asr-000157
00:18:27.460 --> 00:18:36.680
Executive Secretary Ralph Recto: Rest assured, we crafted the proposed budget strictly within the parameters and processes established by the DBM.

asr-000158
00:18:36.680 --> 00:18:38.680
Executive Secretary Ralph Recto: We sought no special treatment.

asr-000159
00:18:38.680 --> 00:18:47.680
Executive Secretary Ralph Recto: We submit this proposal with full respect for Congress's constitutional authority and with readiness to answer your questions.

asr-000161
00:18:51.680 --> 00:18:53.680
Rep. Albert S. Garcia: Thank you very much, Executive Secretary Ralph Recto.

asr-000163
00:18:55.680 --> 00:19:07.680
Rep. Albert S. Garcia: The presentation of the Office of the President having been concluded, the Chair now recognizes the Minority Leader for the proper motion.

asr-000164
