asr-000350
00:40:47.060 --> 00:40:53.100
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: At kung paano rin natin lubos na mapapayaman ang agrikultura, ang manupaktura, ang industriya,

asr-000351
00:40:53.520 --> 00:41:00.920
